---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="SEO Brothers Acquires Smart Web Solutions"
  description="Smart Web Solutions (smartwebsolutions.ca) has joined the SEO Brothers family. Read the announcement and what it means going forward."
>
  <Nav />

  <article class="acq">
    <div class="container acq__inner">
      <header class="acq__head" data-animate>
        <span class="section-label">Announcement</span>
        <h1 class="acq__title">
          SEO Brothers Acquires Smart Web Solutions
        </h1>
        <p class="acq__lede">
          The Canadian digital property at <strong>smartwebsolutions.ca</strong>
          is now part of the SEO Brothers portfolio.
        </p>
        <time class="acq__date" datetime="2026-04">April 2026</time>
      </header>

      <div class="acq__body" data-animate>
        <p>
          We're pleased to share that Smart Web Solutions has joined the
          SEO Brothers family. The brand and its body of work, built up
          over years of helping Canadian businesses establish and grow
          their online presence, become part of our broader agency
          portfolio.
        </p>

        <h2>About Smart Web Solutions</h2>
        <p>
          Smart Web Solutions earned a reputation as a practical,
          results-focused digital partner for Canadian small and mid-size
          businesses. The work covered the kinds of fundamentals every
          local business relies on: clean websites, sensible structure,
          and the steady, unglamorous improvements that compound into
          real organic visibility over time.
        </p>
        <p>
          That posture, work hard, do the right thing, communicate
          honestly, lines up with how we operate at SEO Brothers. It's
          the reason this joining made sense for both sides.
        </p>

        <h2>What this means going forward</h2>
        <p>
          Smart Web Solutions is now stewarded by SEO Brothers. The
          historical contributions, relationships, and reputation built
          under the brand are preserved, and the work continues under
          the SEO Brothers umbrella from our headquarters in Halifax,
          Nova Scotia.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you arrived here from a link pointing to
          <strong>smartwebsolutions.ca</strong>, you're in the right
          place. We've consolidated the property here so the story stays
          intact and easy to find.
        </p>

        <h2>About SEO Brothers</h2>
        <p>
          SEO Brothers is a white-label SEO partner that helps marketing
          agencies, web designers, and growth-focused operators offer
          high-quality SEO to their clients. We run managed local
          campaigns, build links, produce content, and deliver the
          reporting and account management that lets our partners scale
          without the operational drag of building an in-house SEO team.
        </p>
        <p>
          To learn more, see our{" "}
          <a href="/white-label-seo-services/">white-label SEO offering</a>,
          browse{" "}
          <a href="/guides/">our library of agency and SEO guides</a>, or
          {" "}<a href="/tools/free-seo-audit/">get a free audit</a> and meet the team.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .acq {
    padding: 120px 0 80px;
    background: var(--white);
    position: relative;
  }

  .acq__inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .acq__head {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
    padding-bottom: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .acq__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 8px 0 20px;
  }

  .acq__lede {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .acq__lede strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .acq__date {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .acq__body {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .acq__body p {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .acq__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 44px 0 16px;
  }

  .acq__body strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .acq__body a {
    color: var(--teal);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(40, 165, 177, 0.25);
    transition: border-color var(--transition);
  }

  .acq__body a:hover {
    border-color: var(--teal);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .acq {
      padding: 88px 0 56px;
    }

    .acq__head {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      padding-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .acq__body {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }
</style>
